{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2023-01-03 07:00:00', 'title': "CENTENE'S HEALTH NET ISSUED NEW MEDI-CAL DIRECT CONTRACTS BY CALIFORNIA DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH CARE SERVICES", 'text': 'HEALTH NET TO SERVE MEMBERS IN 10 COUNTIES INCLUDING LOS ANGELES AND SACRAMENTO COUNTIES ST. LOUIS , JAN. 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE: CNC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE CALIFORNIA DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH CARE SERVICES (DHCS) HAS SELECTED ITS CALIFORNIA SUBSIDIARY HEALTH NET OF CALIFORNIA (HEALTH NET) FOR DIRECT CONTRACTS IN LOS ANGELES AND SACRAMENTO COUNTIES, INCREASING THE NUMBER OF DIRECT COUNTY CONTRACTS BY DHCS TO 10.'}{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2023-01-02 11:15:00', 'title': 'COMMUNITY HEALTH SYSTEM AND HEALTH NET AGREE ON MULTI-YEAR NETWORK CONTRACT', 'text': "ELIGIBLE FRESNO RESIDENTS ENROLLED ACROSS HEALTH NET'S LINES OF BUSINESS WILL HAVE FULL ACCESS TO COMMUNITY'S THREE MAJOR HOSPITALS IN FRESNO COUNTY. SACRAMENTO, CALIF."}